      are re-checked against the WorldFreightHub Europe route data each month.
    </p>
    <p>
      If a Spanish rail, air, express or DDP dollar rate, a Valencia terminal fee, a Med feeder fee or a
      demurrage/detention schedule becomes available from Spanish Customs, a port operator or a carrier,
      the table is updated, the confidence badge is raised, and the modified date in the page metadata is
      changed. Until then, unquantified Spanish fees and rates stay LOW confidence with a "not published —
      verify" note rather than being filled with estimates.
    </p>
